My name is Giuliano Lancioni. I am Professor of Arabic Language and Literature at the Department of Foreign Languages and Cultures, Roma Tre University.

My research interests are:

+ Arabic formal, computational and corpus linguistics;

+ Formal, computational and corpus linguistics (outside Arabic);

+ History of the Arabic linguistic thinking.

